T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A face from the past threatens Luke and Tally's recharged romance. The team breaches a fortified compound to keep vital intel out of enemy hands.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pKaK4qFbV6g4kSLOgSMTfYZVrfi.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL0Z1YmFyJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.2.3","title":"Tango and Smash","season":2,"episode":3,"released":"2025-06-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Greta attempts to loosen Luke's lips, the safe-house gang gets an earful from afar. Emma turns heads on the dance floor with an unlikely date.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nBNU6hXc2AY44KZgD82mtTBuPap.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL0Z1YmFyJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.2.4","title":"Astro-Not","season":2,"episode":4,"released":"2025-06-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While Cress tightens the screws, Chips matches wits with an interrogation expert. A stealth mission makes a bigger bang than expected.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g8tKR7w6M3Mdl4hHlGWbwlo0iUo.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL0Z1YmFyJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.2.5","title":"Trippin' the Abyss","season":2,"episode":5,"released":"2025-06-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Barry hitches a ride to the final frontier. As an operative's cover story begins to crumble, Luke and Emma seek help from an unexpected ally.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jICQ62ncwWn0OPSxOqotuyWuy0e.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL0Z1YmFyJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.2.6","title":"Penny Possum's Pizzapocalypse","season":2,"episode":6,"released":"2025-06-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Emma and Luke catch a buzz in a deep-sea submersible. Back on land, bullets and breadsticks fly in a confrontation at a pizza joint.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ge6LBsX5PvWCCvEYrGK3LVlTqWg.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL